  "worked_solution": "To make our prediction, we proceed as follows:\n\n- First, we start at $y=20$ on the $y$-axis.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13944892/assets/ad092e8773bbb8707dc95377b20b29a1f6ddab9e973b0a5fa469e15f47f967cc.png)\n\n- Then, we move right until we intersect the trend line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13944892/assets/520c396408909577337035a455f5078df148c491ec9d33a75a0f3bbdcaac9a5f.png)\n\n- Finally, we move down until we intersect the $x$-axis.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13944892/assets/67b44784b133813b84204dc63aedf0a07b7edb67a30c52e3dc17d8567fcccb19.png)\n\nTherefore, when $y=20,$ we obtain $x\u22487.$",
